Sometimes officers (captains and, I think, lieutenants) will have silver
sabers, though sometimes not.  The Castle and Fort Ludios have the best
quantity of officers for you to kill, so if you haven't been there yet,
it's a good shot.

Another idea: is your Valkyrie lawful?  If so, you can get and use
Grayswandir, though you won't be able to #twoweapon with Mojo...

If you want to help your pet vampire take the watch captain down you can hit
him with a wand or potion of sleep so that he won't hit back.  You'll take
a minor alignment penalty for it, but not the major protection, telepathy
losses.

